{"text": "| From: Toinet, Jean-Michel\n\n[Sent: Thursday, August 12, 1999 6:38 AM\nTo: Chemla, Marc R\nce: Ware, Keitn; Paquier, Louis\n\nJSubject: RE: Accord kits for Switzerland\n\u2018Thank you for your note. Fist, let me please update you on where we stand.\n\n1. Keith Ware has initiated a Beta Steering Committee and a Task Foree in the EU Region. He\nhas proposed Switzerland to be represented in both groups. We have welcomed ths initiative\nwhich should help coordinate the project on a more global Euro basis,\n\n2. We have invited Keith to present the project to the CEMA RPC end August so that CEMA,\n\u2018management is informed and has the possibilly to give input to the project.\n\nNow, to your question.\n\u2014 Yes, we are interested in seeing a wnite heating kit. However, at this point in ime, | would not\nrecommend developing a smooth version which would result in extra costs and time. | beleve\nWhite heaters with the current texture would be sufficient for the intial research phase,\nAdditional, a blue case cap ( | assume this refer to the removable cap of the actual heating\ndevice) may be preferable to a white cap for esthetical design reasons and possibly to avoid\nVisibie staining (my speculation)\nCharger on 220 V (with 50 HZ frequency | believe) is OK.\nHowever, ust let us know when this would be ready. Do not ship anything yet \u2014 without\ninformation \u2018rom our side. We're checking on a few items including import duties,\nclassification, etc.\n\nBest regards,\n\nJM, Toin\n\nOriginal Messag\n\n2078636879", "words": [{"text": "|", "x0": 111, "y0": 149, "x1": 116, "y1": 175, "conf": 68.0}, {"text": "From:", "x0": 117, "y0": 149, "x1": 148, "y1": 175, "conf": 68.0}, {"text": "Toinet,", "x0": 179, "y0": 157, "x1": 213, "y1": 167, "conf": 88.0}, {"text": "Jean-Michel", "x0": 218, "y0": 157, "x1": 279, "y1": 166, "conf": 77.0}, {"text": "[Sent:", "x0": 116, "y0": 170, "x1": 144, "y1": 179, "conf": 9.0}, {"text": "Thursday,", "x0": 179, "y0": 170, "